cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: FlowSOM Clustering
abstract: 'Clusters the cells of transformed FCS files with FlowSOM, following the Nature Protocols practice:
  a self-organising map trained on per-sample subsamples, metaclustered, with every event then mapped
  onto it. Writes per-sample cluster counts and medians, metacluster labels from a marker table, the model
  and figures.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-flowsom
license: Apache-2.0
